{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02929","headline":"银潢宫侍宴应制 · 魏元忠","name":"银潢宫侍宴应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"别殿秋云上，离宫夏景移。\n寒风生玉树，凉气下瑶池。\n堑花仍吐叶，岩木尚抽枝。\n愿奉南山寿，千秋长若斯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"魏元忠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02929.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02929","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}